// ASCII Sigil Language - UNICODE EMOJI VERSION! 🎨✨🌈
// Using actual Unicode emojis for maximum visual intuition!
//
// This is what happens when you let linguistics meet emoji! 😍
//
// REVOLUTIONARY FEATURE: Instead of cryptic abbreviations like "vis", "hab",
// we use INTUITIVE EMOJI/UNICODE that you can SEE and FEEL!

// === EMOJI LINGUISTIC MARKERS ===
//
// 1. EVIDENTIALITY (How do you know?)
//    👁️ - I SAW it directly (visual evidence)
//    🔍 - I INFERRED it (deduced from clues)
//    👂 - I HEARD it (hearsay/tradition tells us)
//    🔮 - I SENSE it (intuitive/mystical knowledge)
//
// 2. ASPECT (How does it unfold in time?)
//    🔁 - HABITUAL (happens repeatedly)
//    ✅ - PERFECTIVE (completed action)
//    ▶️ - PROGRESSIVE (ongoing right now)
//    🌱 - INCEPTIVE (just beginning)
//    🛑 - CESSATIVE (coming to an end)
//
// 3. ATTUNEMENT (Your relationship to magic)
//    🌿 - NATURAL (innate affinity)
//    🔨 - FORCED (compelling against will)
//    ☯️ - HARMONIOUS (mutual cooperation)
//    ⚔️ - DISCORDANT (conflicting/resisting)
//
// 4. HONORIFICS (Level of respect)
//    🙇 - HUMBLE (I bow before it)
//    😐 - NEUTRAL (equal standing)
//    🙏 - HONORIFIC (respectful)
//    👑 - SACRED (highest reverence)
//
// 5. ANIMACY (Level of consciousness)
//    🧠 - SENTIENT (aware, thinking)
//    💚 - LIVING (alive but not aware)
//    👻 - SPIRITUAL (ethereal essence)
//    🪨 - INERT (dormant, lifeless)
//
// 6. DIRECTIONALITY (Energy flow)
//    ⬆️ - UPWARD (ascending to heavens)
//    ⬇️ - DOWNWARD (grounding to earth)
//    ⏺️ - INWARD (centralizing to core)
//    💫 - OUTWARD (radiating from center)
//    ⭕ - CYCLICAL (eternal circle)
//
// 7. MODAL (Necessity/possibility)
//    🤔 - POTENTIAL (might, maybe)
//    ❗ - NECESSARY (must, required)
//    🚫 - PROHIBITED (forbidden)
//    📋 - OBLIGATED (should, ought to)
//    ⭐ - DESIRED (wish, hope)
//
// 8. SWITCH-REFERENCE (Focus tracking)
//    ➡️ - SAME subject continues
//    🔀 - DIFFERENT subject
//    🪞 - REFLEXIVE (acts on itself)
//
// 9. TEMPORAL DISTANCE (How far in time?)
//    ⚡ - IMMEDIATE (right now!)
//    📅 - RECENT (lately, just now)
//    🏛️ - REMOTE (ancient, long ago)
//
// 10. CLUSIVITY (Who participates?)
//     👥 - INCLUSIVE we (including you)
//     🚶🚶 - EXCLUSIVE we (not you)
//     🧍 - SOLO (I alone)

// === TOP-LEVEL SIGIL ===
Sigil -> AnnotatedContainer
Sigil -> AnnotatedElement
Sigil -> AnnotatedComposite

// === ANNOTATED STRUCTURES ===
AnnotatedContainer -> Evidential Container
AnnotatedContainer -> Honorific Container
AnnotatedContainer -> Modal Container
AnnotatedContainer -> Aspectual Container
AnnotatedContainer -> Directional Container
AnnotatedContainer -> Container

AnnotatedElement -> Attunement Element
AnnotatedElement -> Animacy Element
AnnotatedElement -> Element

AnnotatedComposite -> TemporalDistance Composite
AnnotatedComposite -> Clusivity Composite
AnnotatedComposite -> SwitchRef Composite
AnnotatedComposite -> Composite

// === EVIDENTIALITY: How we know ===
Evidential[ evid: direct ] -> eye
Evidential[ evid: inferred ] -> mag
Evidential[ evid: hearsay ] -> ear
Evidential[ evid: intuitive ] -> crystal

// === ASPECT: Temporal structure ===
Aspectual[ aspect: habitual ] -> repeat
Aspectual[ aspect: perfective ] -> check
Aspectual[ aspect: progressive ] -> play
Aspectual[ aspect: inceptive ] -> sprout
Aspectual[ aspect: cessative ] -> stop

// === ATTUNEMENT: Relationship to elements ===
Attunement[ attune: natural ] -> leaf
Attunement[ attune: forced ] -> hammer
Attunement[ attune: harmonious ] -> yin
Attunement[ attune: discordant ] -> sword

// === HONORIFICS: Respect level ===
Honorific[ honor: humble ] -> bow
Honorific[ honor: neutral ] -> neutral
Honorific[ honor: honorific ] -> pray
Honorific[ honor: sacred ] -> crown

// === ANIMACY: Consciousness level ===
Animacy[ anim: sentient ] -> brain
Animacy[ anim: living ] -> heart
Animacy[ anim: spiritual ] -> ghost
Animacy[ anim: inert ] -> rock

// === DIRECTIONALITY: Energy flow ===
Directional[ direction: upward ] -> up
Directional[ direction: downward ] -> down
Directional[ direction: inward ] -> center
Directional[ direction: outward ] -> radiate
Directional[ direction: cyclical ] -> circle

// === MODAL: Intention/necessity ===
Modal[ mode: potential ] -> maybe
Modal[ mode: necessary ] -> must
Modal[ mode: prohibited ] -> forbidden
Modal[ mode: obligated ] -> should
Modal[ mode: desired ] -> wish

// === SWITCH-REFERENCE: Focus tracking ===
SwitchRef[ switch: same ] -> same
SwitchRef[ switch: different ] -> diff
SwitchRef[ switch: reflexive ] -> mirror

// === TEMPORAL DISTANCE ===
TemporalDistance[ time: immediate ] -> now
TemporalDistance[ time: recent ] -> recent
TemporalDistance[ time: remote ] -> ancient

// === CLUSIVITY: Participation ===
Clusivity[ clus: inclusive ] -> together
Clusivity[ clus: exclusive ] -> apart
Clusivity[ clus: solo ] -> alone

// === CONTAINERS (unchanged) ===
Container[ type: amplify, energy: #e ] -> LAngle Contents[ energy: #e ] RAngle
Container[ type: stabilize, energy: low ] -> LBracket Contents[ energy: #e ] RBracket
Container[ type: transform ] -> LBrace FusedContents RBrace
Container[ type: channel, energy: #e, state: #s ] -> LParen Contents[ energy: #e, state: #s ] RParen

// === CONTENTS ===
Contents -> Element
Contents -> Element Contents
Contents -> Container
Contents -> Container Contents
Contents -> AnnotatedContainer
Contents -> AnnotatedElement

// === FUSED CONTENTS ===
FusedContents -> Element Operator Element
FusedContents -> Element Operator Element Operator Element
FusedContents -> Element
FusedContents -> PowerElement
FusedContents -> Container Operator Element
FusedContents -> Element Operator Container
FusedContents -> Container Operator Container
FusedContents -> AnnotatedElement Operator AnnotatedElement

// === POWER ELEMENTS ===
PowerElement -> Element Element
PowerElement -> Element PowerElement

// === COMPOSITE ===
Composite -> Sigil Operator Sigil
Composite -> Sigil Sigil

// === BASE ELEMENTS ===
Element[ type: fire, energy: high, state: volatile, aspect: aggressive ] -> fire
Element[ type: water, energy: medium, state: flowing, aspect: adaptive ] -> water
Element[ type: air, energy: medium, state: free, aspect: swift ] -> air
Element[ type: earth, energy: low, state: solid, aspect: protective ] -> earth
Element[ type: void, energy: none, state: ethereal, aspect: mysterious ] -> void

// === OPERATORS ===
Operator -> plus
Operator -> minus
Operator -> pipe

// === CONTAINER DELIMITERS ===
LAngle   -> langle
RAngle   -> rangle
LBracket -> lbrack
RBracket -> rbrack
LBrace   -> lbrace
RBrace   -> rbrace
LParen   -> lparen
RParen   -> rparen
